cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these lessons, images, code or findings, please cite this repository as below, and cite the scroll data you use as listed under references (Vesuvius Challenge data is CC BY-NC 4.0; EduceLab-Scrolls data carries its own citation requirement)."
title: "Scroll Lessons (Dominion): every experiment and lesson from an AI-run search for ink in the Herculaneum scrolls"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
