repository-code: "https://github.com/abundantjoe/scroll-lessons"
url: "https://github.com/abundantjoe/scroll-lessons"
abstract: "Dominion was directed by Joseph Balmaceda and run by Claude research agents (Anthropic) from September to October 2026. This repository holds MASTER_LESSONS.md, every lesson, experiment verdict and retracted claim from the programme in one file meant to be given to an AI system as context, plus one scrubbed snapshot branch per experiment, ink-model images of unread scroll areas, and the stripqc finding (blank render margins corrupt villa ink inference on thin strips)."
keywords: ["Herculaneum papyri", "Vesuvius Challenge", "ink detection", "virtual unwrapping", "lessons learned", "AI research agents"]
